  "notes": "Watts' prolific melodic-street singer-rapper — \"emo music for gangbangers\" — and the research gives this one a parameter almost nothing else in the lane has: **incompleteness is the style, not a defect**. He takes \"whatever beat is thrown his way (or that he produced),\" including deliberately \"unfinished beats,\" so the drums are authored as absence — `hihat.continuous` false at the 0.28 `fillDensity` floor (\"missing hats\"), `quantizeStrength` 0.60 and `velocityVar` 0.26 for the stated \"low-fidelity, under-quantised\" programming, and `transitions.dropOutBeats.prob` 0.75 for \"kicks that drop for bars\". ⚠ **The research says \"no fills\" and the fingerprint says fills.** The band's `fills` 4/4 is kept because a shared fill fingerprint is what stops nine models converging on one turnaround; what carries the research's claim instead is `snareRoll.gapProb` at **0.64, the highest in this batch** — the roll is mostly holes — plus `snareRollLadder` off and the fill lane pinned to the clap. That is the honest compromise and it is named here rather than hidden. ⛔ `chords.impliedByRiff` is set: \"single sustained pad or a two-note bell over a static minor chord ... harmony is a bed, not a progression.\" ⚠ **The top line is a voice, not a keyboard.** The research: \"wails, yelps, and groans,\" \"off-key crooning and vocal cracks\" treated as intentional; model as \"microtonally loose, wide-range, minor-pentatonic with blue-3\". So `melody.register` spans 31 semitones (the widest here), `intervals.leap` is 0.28, `halfStepDissonance` is 0.14, `octaveJumpProb` 0.24, `scales` lead with `minor_pentatonic` and `blues`, and `timbreHint` is a pitched vocal rather than a synth. This catalogue is **~75% minor, the most minor-weighted in the lane**, so the major share the genre keeps is dropped entirely. ⚠ `confidence` is `medium` on the research's medium-high, and the research says **gear and workflow are unsourced** — `bass808.distortion` (\"sometimes clipping\") and the arrangement bar counts are the inferred parameters. Fill fingerprint band G. ⚠ **`lockTo808` raised from 0.6 to 0.65.** The 808 takes each kick with this probability, and at 0.6 over this model's 4-kick floor a seed could produce no 808 at all — which `bass808.rs` refuses, because a declared 808 that sometimes vanishes is a part a producer cannot rely on. It is still well under a lock: a good share of kicks carry no sub.",
